            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abantu banyu obu balyekaguza bati, ‘Kiki MUKAMA Ruhanga waitu ekyatukoliire ebintu binu?’ Mubagarukemu muti, ‘Nkooku mwandugireho mwaheereza embandwa zabanyamahanga omunsi yanyu, nukwo muliheereza abanyamahanga omunsi etali yanyu.’”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.5.19"
            ]
